shboard to monitor arrivals/departures, and implemented a nightly Airflow job to automatically mark no-show trucks, **improving operational visibility**.\n*   *Skills*: REST APIs, ReactJS, Software Design, PostgreSQL, PHP Slim Framework, Git, Database Design, PHP\n\n**Warehouse System Migration**\n*   Served as lead engineer on the integration of an acquired company’s pick-to-light warehouse system.\n*   Designed and implemented SFTP-based integration to connect external warehouse hardware systems to internal infrastructure, playing a key role in successfully migrating warehousing operations post-acquisition.\n*   *Skills*: PHP, Software Design, Git, PHP Slim Framework, PostgreSQL\n\n**On-Call Engineering Support**\n*   Participated in on-call rotations, diagnosing and resolving production incidents through code changes and targeted SQL updates, ensuring system stability and performance.\n*   *Skills*: PostgreSQL, DataDog, PHP, PHP Slim Framework"}
